				<box topPadding="0" leftPadding="2" bottomPadding="0" rightPadding="0"/>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top" rotation="None">
					<font fontName="Aptos" size="10"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["Please find attached your "+ (($F{PolicyNo} != null && !$F{PolicyNo}.trim().isEmpty()) ? "policy schedule" : "quote details") + 
("100048".equalsIgnoreCase($F{CompanyId})?"Please find attached your policy schedule for your records. Should you need any amendments, additional information, or assistance, our agent or broker will be happy to assist. In their absence, you can reach us directly at +258 21 48 5376 or +258 85 047 6875.":"100046".equalsIgnoreCase($F{CompanyId})?"Please find attached your policy schedule for your records. Should you need any amendments, additional information, or assistance, our agent or broker will be happy to assist. In their absence, you can reach us directly at +260-760-830635.":"100050".equalsIgnoreCase($F{CompanyId})?"Please find attached your policy schedule for your records. Should you need any amendments, additional information, or assistance, our agent or broker will be happy to assist. In their absence, you can reach us directly at +264 61 256 633.":"100049".equalsIgnoreCase($F{CompanyId})?"Please find attached your policy schedule for your records. Should you need any amendments, additional information, or assistance, our agent or broker will be happy to assist. In their absence, you can reach us directly at +268 2404 0034 or +268 7672 5682.":" for your records. Should you need any amendments, additional information, or assistance, your agent or broker will be happy to assist. In their absence, you can reach us directly at 316 1322 (Gaborone Branch) or 242 1510 (Francistown Branch).")]]></textFieldExpression>
			</textField>
			<textField isStretchWithOverflow="true" isBlankWhenNull="true">
